</table>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Results on test tasks. Average Travel Distance (ATD) and Average Success Time (AST) are reported in meters and seconds, respectively. SR denotes Success Rate, while ‘obst.’ refers to high obstacles. Ext. Par. stands for <span id="S4.T2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Extreme Parkour</span>. The ’/’ indicates no successful episodes.</span></figcaption>
<table id="S4.T2.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S4.T2.6.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.6.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S4.T2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.6.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span> <span id="S4.T2.6.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S4.T2.6.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="S4.T2.6.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S4.T2.6.1.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">Test</span></span>
